codex
Premise 2 needs a qualification: `wdc_altoffset_probe.py` has two parent-process assertions for table integrity. Its measurement verdict still only prints. I also found its omitted sentinel, `ALTOFF_DET_DONE`, and explicit expected values in the signature probe, including rows whose table “want” is blank.
